{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FIGHT-QUEST is a fast-paced, first-person melee rougelite that combines the brutal, high-speed combat of FPS titles like ULTRAKILL with the addictive mutating upgrades of roguelites like Balatro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employed as a &quot;hero&quot; for a mysterious wizard, you\u2019ll battle through an onslaught of fantasy foes, earning gold to upgrade your abilities and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/05757b08c8687ff14c62deb03d817935.poster.avif?t=1759899242\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/05757b08c8687ff14c62deb03d817935.webm?t=1759899242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soulslike melee combat with the fast-paced, first-person brutality of the FPS genre.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/d22eb92e90d1cd1c2768035d0b35a384.poster.avif?t=1759899242\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/d22eb92e90d1cd1c2768035d0b35a384.webm?t=1759899242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unlikely companion is here to help - Discover hundreds of unique character builds as you battle the horde.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/917646438f8e92da61e69227a4f035f5.poster.avif?t=1759899242\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/917646438f8e92da61e69227a4f035f5.webm?t=1759899242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract to a stronghold with your collections - If you have the coin, shopkeepers will unlock new arenas, weaponry, and advantageous supplies.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3685570?t=1759899242","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/17bef1f3c57a22db59cd72200f16804aebc4976f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759899242","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/d2dad3f837dd7fd4f1150042639f5bb6cc21985e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759899242","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/d2dad3f837dd7fd4f1150042639f5bb6cc21985e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759899242","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FIGHT-QUEST is a fast-paced, first-person melee rougelite that combines the brutal, high-speed combat of FPS titles like ULTRAKILL with the addictive mutating upgrades of roguelites like Balatro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employed as a &quot;hero&quot; for a mysterious wizard, you\u2019ll battle through an onslaught of fantasy foes, earning gold to upgrade your abilities and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poste